<title>UK: Credit Local sets 200 bln lire structured bond.</title>
<headline>Credit Local sets 200 bln lire structured bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following structured bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIT LOCAL DE FRANCE</p>
<p> AMT    200 BLN ITL   COUPON   **8.00	MATURITY    07.MAR.02</p>
<p> TYPE   FIX/REV FRN   ISS PRICE  101.075   PAY DATE    07.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.45</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMS US/UK/FR/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  FRANCE    TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.625</p>
<p> NOTES    **FOR FIRST SIX MONTHS, THEREAFTER 4.05 PCT PLUS</p>
<p>		(SIX MONTH LIRA LIBOR MINUS SIX MONTH DEM LIBOR)</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
